{
  "title": "AMI · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "EC2를 시작할 때 사용하는 이미지 템플릿이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#root-volume\">Root Volume</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#block-device-mapping\">Block Device Mapping</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#ebs-backed-ami\">EBS-backed AMI</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#instance-store-backed-ami\">Instance Store-backed AMI</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#architecture-and-virtualization\">Architecture and Virtualization</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#copying-and-sharing\">Copying and Sharing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#image-versioning-and-deregistration\">Image Versioning and Deregistration</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>02 / 62</span></div><h1>AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>를 시작하기 위한 OS·Software 이미지와 Metadata를 가진 Template이다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#ebs-backed-ami\">EBS-backed AMI</a>는 보통 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#root-volume\">Root Volume</a> 및 선택한 데이터 Volume의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">EBS Snapshot</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#block-device-mapping\">Block Device Mapping</a>을 참조한다.</p><p>이미지 시점에 Disk에 기록된 OS·Program·Data를 담을 수 있지만 실행 중인 RAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Resource Access Manager)</span>·Process·현재 TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span> 연결까지 저장하는 것은 아니다. 모든 연결 Disk가 무조건 포함되는 것도 아니므로 Mapping을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Image 생성과 새 Instance 실행\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Image 생성과 새 Instance 실행</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Image creation</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Configured <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></strong><small>OS·설치 프로그램·Disk 데이터</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span> + <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> Snapshots</strong><small>지원 Volume의 시점 Image</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Regional AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span></strong><small>Launch 권한·Encryption 확인</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>New instance</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span> selection</strong><small>같은 OS·앱 출발점</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>New <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> Volumes</strong><small>Snapshot으로 Disk 생성</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>New <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> process state</strong><small>Memory·실행 중 Process는 새로 시작</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span>는 실행 중 Memory를 통째로 복제하는 VM Suspend 파일이 아니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"root-volume\"><h2>Root Volume<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#root-volume\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Boot와 OS가 있는 Root Device의 내용을 정의한다. AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span>에서 새 Instance를 시작하면 이미지에서 새 Volume을 만든다. 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>가 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#root-volume\">Root Volume</a>을 직접 공유하는 방식이 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"block-device-mapping\"><h2>Block Device Mapping<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#block-device-mapping\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Root 외의 추가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> Volume과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#instance-store\">Instance Store</a> Mapping 등을 명시한다. 원본 Instance의 모든 Storage가 자동으로 같은 방식으로 복사된다고 가정하지 않는다. 포함 Volume, 크기, 타입, DeleteOnTermination을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ebs-backed-ami\"><h2>EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span>-backed AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#ebs-backed-ami\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">EBS Snapshot</a>을 참조해 Volume을 복원하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>를 시작한다. 생성 전에 File System·Database 쓰기를 정리하면 일관성을 높일 수 있다. No-reboot 생성은 앱 일관성 문제를 스스로 처리해야 할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"instance-store-backed-ami\"><h2>Instance Store-backed AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#instance-store-backed-ami\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#instance-store\">Instance Store</a> 기반 Root 이미지의 별도 Boot 모델이다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a>-backed와 Stop·Storage 지속성 조건이 다르다. 현재 지원 Instance·Virtualization 조합을 확인하고 일반 신규 구성에서는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a>-backed의 운영 특성을 우선 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"architecture-and-virtualization\"><h2>Architecture and Virtualization<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#architecture-and-virtualization\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span> Architecture와 Instance Type Architecture가 맞아야 한다. HVM·Boot Mode 등 시작 호환성도 확인한다. 이름만 같은 Linux 이미지라고 모든 Graviton·x86 Instance에서 동일하게 실행되지는 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"copying-and-sharing\"><h2>Copying and Sharing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#copying-and-sharing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 범위를 가지므로 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>에서 쓰려면 복사한다. 계정에 Launch Permission을 공유하고 암호화 Snapshot을 쓰면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> 권한도 필요하다. Public 공유 전에 Secret·사용자 데이터가 포함되지 않았는지 점검한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"image-versioning-and-deregistration\"><h2>Image Versioning and Deregistration<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#image-versioning-and-deregistration\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>새 Software 버전은 새 AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span>로 만들고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#launch-template\">Launch Template</a>의 버전을 업데이트한다. AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span> Deregistration과 관련 Snapshot 삭제·보존 정책은 별개로 확인한다. 기존 실행 Instance는 AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span> 버전 변경만으로 자동 업데이트되지 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>설정된 웹 서버에서 Golden AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span>를 만들면 새 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>가 같은 OS·Program을 시작할 수 있다. 업로드 파일과 세션은 별도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>·DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>에 두어 이미지 교체와 분리한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span>는 실행 중인 서버의 공유 파일 시스템이 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/AMIs.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/AMIs.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q027/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q027\" data-question=\"Q027\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q027</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q027/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to repeatedly launch EC2 instances with the same operating system and application. Which template should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q027\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q027\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q027\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q027\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SNS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 시작 이미지를 제공한다. 런타임의 변경 데이터는 별도 저장해야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q061\" data-question=\"Q061\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q061</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q061/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application on EC2 needs S3 access. Instead of embedding a long-term access key in the AMI, what should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Embed the root account key</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Make the S3 bucket public</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an IAM role to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow all traffic in the network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 역할을 통한 임시 자격 증명과 최소 권한 정책이 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q031\" data-question=\"Q031\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q031</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q031/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to add EC2 instances as web traffic changes and replace unhealthy instances. Which feature should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q031\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q031\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q031\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q031\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS snapshots only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a>가 원하는 용량과 확장 정책, 상태 확인을 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">EC2 Auto Scaling</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q032\" data-question=\"Q032\" data-revision=\"2\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q032</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q032/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company must use existing per-socket software licenses on EC2 and needs visibility into physical sockets and cores, plus control over instance placement on a specific host. Which option should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Hosts</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compute Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>는 Physical Host의 Socket·Core 가시성과 Instance Placement·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Host Affinity</a>를 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 전용 Hardware 격리를 제공하지만 같은 Host 제어·가시성을 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q046\" data-question=\"Q046\" data-revision=\"2\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q046</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q046/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company requires EC2 instances to run on hardware isolated from instances belonging to other AWS accounts. It does not need socket visibility, host affinity, or control over a specific physical server. Which option most directly meets these requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Regional Reserved Instances in shared tenancy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 다른 계정과 Hardware를 분리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>의 Host 제어가 필요하지 않은 요구와 구분한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">Capacity Reservation</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>는 그 자체로 Dedicated Tenancy를 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">이전 용어 <b>ACM</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">다음 용어 <b>API Gateway</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
